{"id":"n5-035","title":"Noun に なります (Noun ni narimasu)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Expresses change or becoming something; 'to become', 'to turn into', 'to be'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point Noun に なります is used to express a change or transformation into something else, or to indicate that something 'becomes', 'turns into', or simply 'is' something. It is commonly used with nouns.","formation":"Noun + に + なります","examples":[{"jp":"彼は医者になります。","romaji":"Kare wa isha ni narimasu.","en":"He will become a doctor.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"医者","vocabId":"1159980","reading":"いしゃ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"この茶色の葉が赤になります。","romaji":"Kono chairo no ha ga aka ni narimasu.","en":"These brown leaves will turn red.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"茶色","vocabId":"1422720","reading":"ちゃいろ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"葉","vocabId":"1546550","reading":"は"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"赤","vocabId":"2013900","reading":"あか"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"料理が冷めたら、美味しくなくなります。","romaji":"Ryouri ga sametara, oishikunaku narimasu.","en":"When the dish cools down, it becomes less delicious.","words":[{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"冷め","vocabId":"1556750","reading":"さめる"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美味しく","vocabId":"1486650","reading":"おいしい"},{"surface":"なく","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"来年、東京オリンピックになります。","romaji":"Rainen, Toukyou Orinpikku ni narimasu.","en":"Next year, it will be 